296
00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.548
Yeah.

297
00:16:47.631 --> 00:16:48.674
Articles.

298
00:16:50.217 --> 00:16:51.343
About what?

299
00:16:51.427 --> 00:16:52.803
About Bicolano food.

300
00:16:54.471 --> 00:16:55.514
Perfect!

301
