you will not just taste the heat.

324
00:17:49.026 --> 00:17:50.569
you will experience it.

325
00:17:50.652 --> 00:17:52.654
This is your special seat.

326
00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:55.199
Thank you. Wow.

327
00:17:55.282 --> 00:17:58.786
