389
00:22:41.735 --> 00:22:44.613
[sensual rock music playing]

390
00:22:51.828 --> 00:22:53.497
I'm getting married.

391
00:23:20.023 --> 00:23:21.650
[muffled dialogue]

392
00:23:21.733 --> 00:23:24.736
