Our first baby.

416
00:24:37.434 --> 00:24:38.393
I have to go. Ba. Sorry.

417
00:24:38.476 --> 00:24:39.311
-I'll check it later!
-Ba!

418
00:24:39.394 --> 00:24:41.521
[Juancho] Ma'am. sir. free taste?

419
00:24:41.605 --> 00:24:42.689
[Juancho] Kinalas nachos.

420
00:24:43.356 --> 00:24:44.941
