426
00:25:00.790 --> 00:25:02.042
[heavy chopping]

427
00:25:02.125 --> 00:25:03.001
[knife thumps]

428
00:25:06.713 --> 00:25:09.049
She didn't just wrong me.

429
00:25:09.716 --> 00:25:12.219
