all the requirements that I sent you.

443
00:25:40.580 --> 00:25:42.666
Yes. I have everything here. ma'am.

444
00:25:42.749 --> 00:25:44.000
I have it with me.

445
00:25:44.084 --> 00:25:46.294
[gloomy music playing]

446
00:25:52.467 --> 00:25:55.762
