-[Matt on phone] Hi. babe.

503
00:29:23.928 --> 00:29:25.388
How are you?

504
00:29:25.472 --> 00:29:26.514
How's Bicol?

505
00:29:26.598 --> 00:29:27.765
Good.

506
00:29:28.516 --> 00:29:29.684
It's hot. though.

507
00:29:31.144 --> 00:29:34.522
